On Thu, 22 May 2003, Maurice Hilarius wrote:

>I just tried to order 20 copies of Red Hat Professional 7.2 for Alpha
>Boxed sets.
>
>This is the news I got back from "the new HP":
>
>Sent: Thursday, May 22, 2003 8:02 AM
