"Offline" means there is something wrong with the drive.  I my own         
experience, a head crash on the drive...  If you have another              
computer, you can try pulling the drive and putting it in there.           
That might tell you if the the problem is the drive or the IDE
interface on the motherboard.  You might also want to try a
different IDE cable.

Alan

