This is a warning for anyone wanting to switch to SRM on an LX164.
If you go to:
http://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware/archive/alphapc164lx.html

under "AlphaBIOS Update Floppy" you will be linked to lx164_v5_8.exe.
This is the wrong file.  AlphaBIOS will report an invalid checksum.
The correct file is lx164srm.rom in the same directory.

