Red Hat Enterprise Linux for AMD64 will be shipping later this 
fall as a fully supported product.

Red Hat does not preannounce plans about the base Red Hat Linux
product such as what architectures will or will not be supported,
what version the OS will be, product codenames, release dates,
etc.


