Dear List

Does anybody run JBoss v3.x successfully on an Alpha? It looks like a
silly question, but I experience some weird AbstractMethodErrors. JBoss
needs a JVM 1.3+ and as far as I know the only JVM for Alpha which
satisfies this prequisite is the JVM from Compaq [1]. If someone can
tell us it's running on her/his Linux-Alpha (under what JVM) it would be
of great help to us.


Thank you, Florian Steinsiepe and Adrian Zaugg.


[1] http://h18012.www1.hp.com/java/download/linux/1.3.1/index.html



