Do you have a second hard drive you could connect?

You can format the hard drive as ISO9660 filesystem then copy 
across the firmware CDROM to the hard drive, re-flash the
firmware by choosing the disk device as the source.

I did this on a Tru64 system with a similar problem, in that
case a broken CDROM drive and I FTP'd the contents from another
system, to create the ISO9660 image on the spare disk.


