Are you sure about the performance hit? I don't see why it would be
any slower. In fact, I'd expect it to be marginally faster because of
more efficient cache usage.

> Unfortunately, judging by the manual pages, they didn't port this
> bit of the compiler to linux. 

It's there in newer versions, only the man pages didn't get
updated. I've never really tested it, though...

-- 
	Falk



